Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Services Not Starting
Problem: Wazuh services fail to start Solution:

# Check system resources
free -h
df -h

# Check service logs
sudo journalctl -u wazuh-manager -f
sudo journalctl -u elasticsearch -f
Issue 2: Agent Not Connecting
Problem: Wazuh agent cannot connect to manager Solution:

# Check agent configuration
sudo cat /var/ossec/etc/ossec.conf | grep -A 5 -B 5 server

# Restart agent
sudo systemctl restart wazuh-agent

# Check connectivity
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 1514
Issue 3: Kibana Not Accessible
Problem: Cannot access Kibana dashboard Solution:

# Check Kibana status and logs
sudo systemctl status kibana
sudo journalctl -u kibana -f

# Verify port binding
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 5601

# Check Elasticsearch connectivity
curl -X GET "127.0.0.1:9200/_cluster/health"
